  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不速之客的方案会  (Outside Guests at an Internal Pitch)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping outside the conference room, Chun Yuqiao discovers that sponsors and talent-agency reps have been invited to an internal review—and sees straight through Qin Xiao's ambush. Listen to their exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天开会的事，你们打算什么时候告诉我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你怎么知道我们有方案会啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司所有的会议，我有权限知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "秦助理怎么一个人来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "今天的会有广告商还有艺人经纪代表，他们在会前沟通呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是说内部会议吗？哪儿来的什么代表？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任说了，都是自己人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们知不知道这么做让事情更复杂了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "原来事情已经很复杂了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以你是故意突然袭击我们的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是一小助理呗，哪有那么大能量啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家坐吧，那咱们就开门见山，直奔主题吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天开会的事，你们打算什么时候告诉我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When were you planning to tell me about today's meeting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你怎么知道我们有方案会啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you find out we had a proposal meeting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司所有的会议，我有权限知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have the authority to see every meeting across the company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "秦助理怎么一个人来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assistant Qin, why did you come over by yourself?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "今天的会有广告商还有艺人经纪代表，他们在会前沟通呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today's meeting includes advertisers and talent-agency reps; they are chatting beforehand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是说内部会议吗？哪儿来的什么代表？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was this not supposed to be an internal meeting? Where did outside representatives come from?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任说了，都是自己人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our director said everyone here counts as family.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们知不知道这么做让事情更复杂了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you realise doing this makes the whole matter much more complicated?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "原来事情已经很复杂了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, was the situation complicated already?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以你是故意突然袭击我们的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So you deliberately staged a surprise ambush on us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是一小助理呗，哪有那么大能量啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am just a junior assistant—how could I wield that kind of clout?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家坐吧，那咱们就开门见山，直奔主题吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone take a seat; let us cut straight to the point.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
